{"props":{"pageProps":{"listing":{"id":"a7ceb979-ce0d-4561-878d-974aff89d66a","title":"Colosseum Crypto World's Fair Hackathon | Superteam Singapore Track","slug":"colosseum-crypto-worlds-fair-hackathon-superteam-singapore-track","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003eAbout Superteam Singapore\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eSuperteam Singapore is a community of founders, developers, and operators. For the Crypto World's Fair Hackathon, we're really looking to support the innovative projects coming out of our local Singapore track.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003eMission\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eCreate a project for the Crypto World's Fair Hackathon that delivers meaningful value to the Solana ecosystem, specifically targeting real-world problems and user growth.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003eHackathon Track Scope\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eThis track is for projects built by teams based in Singapore for the Crypto World's Fair Hackathon. We're looking for projects that:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eDeliver meaningful value to the Solana ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eAddress real-world problems that Solana can solve.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eAttract new users to Solana or increase engagement among existing users.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003eSubmission Requirements\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYour project must be submitted to the Colosseum portal and also on Superteam Earn.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYour project must be eligible according to the official rules of the global hackathon.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYou must register for the hackathon on the Colosseum platform and select \"Singapore\" as your country.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003eJudging Criteria\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEcosystem Impact:\u003c/strong\u003e Does your project significantly contribute to the Solana ecosystem through infrastructure, tooling, or tangible value?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct-Market Fit:\u003c/strong\u003e Is there a clear demand for your project and show early signs of traction or validation?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUser Growth Potential:\u003c/strong\u003e Can your project attract new users to Solana or boost engagement among current users?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003eReward Structure\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e1st Place: 2500 USDG\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e2nd Place: 1500 USDG\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e3rd Place: 1000 USDG\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","deadline":"2026-10-13T06:59:00.000Z","commitmentDate":"2026-10-27T15:59:59.999Z","eligibility":[{"type":"text","order":1,"optional":false,"question":"Project Name"},{"type":"text","order":2,"optional":false,"question":"Project Description"},{"type":"link","order":3,"optional":false,"question":"Project Github Link"},{"type":"link","order":4,"optional":true,"question":"Project Website"},{"type":"link","order":5,"optional":true,"question":"Project X Link"},{"type":"link","order":6,"optional":false,"question":"Link to your pitch deck or Loom/video presentation"},{"type":"text","order":7,"optional":false,"question":"Did you submit this project to the official Frontier Hackathon on Colosseum? (Yes/No)"},{"type":"link","order":8,"optional":true,"question":"Link to Colosseum project"},{"type":"link","order":9,"optional":true,"question":"Link to your project's Colosseum profile"}],"status":"OPEN","token":"USDG","rewardAmount":5000,"rewards":{"1":2500,"2":1500,"3":1000},"maxBonusSpots":0,"sponsorId":"04c9441c-c964-4be9-995c-ba4eff8acaaf","isPublished":true,"skills":[{"skills":"Frontend","subskills":[]},{"skills":"Backend","subskills":[]},{"skills":"Mobile","subskills":[]},{"skills":"Blockchain","subskills":[]},{"skills":"Design","subskills":["UI/UX Design"]}],"type":"hackathon","requirements":null,"isWinnersAnnounced":false,"region":"Singapore","pocSocials":"https://t.me/kimmiunni","publishedAt":"2026-09-17T09:41:34.950Z","isPrivate":false,"agentAccess":"HUMAN_ONLY","hackathonId":"df89585d-1a7a-433a-bf4a-bdcc7a6e0070","compensationType":"fixed","maxRewardAsk":null,"minRewardAsk":null,"isFndnPaying":true,"winnersAnnouncedAt":null,"isPro":false,"sponsor":{"name":"Superteam Singapore","logo":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dgvnuwspr/image/upload/v1724412324/earn-sponsor/vpi6tppfogt8co1aauwq.png","slug":"suptereamsg","url":"https://sg.superteam.fun","entityName":"Superteam Singapore","isVerified":true,"isCaution":false},"poc":{"id":"c503f324-7519-429f-96f2-0a7fc09c42df","firstName":"Kimmi","lastName":"Kim","username":"kimmiunni","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ2zlN9iTjarPZptgDB9IfN6uscxhU7oOuB0p_7WAPHU5gJFQ=s96-c"},"Hackathon":{"logo":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dgvnuwspr/image/upload/assets/hackathon/crypto-world-fair/logo.png","altLogo":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dgvnuwspr/image/upload/assets/hackathon/crypto-world-fair/logo.png","startDate":"2026-09-14T15:00:00.000Z","deadline":"2026-10-13T06:59:00.000Z","name":"Crypto World's Fair","description":"Submit to the side tracks of the latest Solana Global Hackath